{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563270/extras/bounce.gif?t=1745548571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as R0-L0 (a spherical robot from outer space) to <strong>roll</strong>, <strong>jump</strong>, and <strong>bounce</strong> through 6 colorful worlds to collect energy shards, so they can return home! Robo Rolo is a physics-based 3D collectathon platformer with fine-tuned, skill based movement that's fun to play, and even more fun to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563270/extras/collect2.gif?t=1745548571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to collecting energy shards, which unlock the way forward, you can collect sparks which allow you to upgrade your movement abilities even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563270/extras/small_capsule.png?t=1745548571\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563270?t=1745548571","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563270?t=1745548571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563270/cb7c8c2879b17ebc9cdfa3729d4d83c88e8bc34a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745548571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563270/cb7c8c2879b17ebc9cdfa3729d4d83c88e8bc34a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745548571","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563270/extras/bounce.gif?t=1745548571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as R0-L0 (a spherical robot from outer space) to <strong>roll</strong>, <strong>jump</strong>, and <strong>bounce</strong> through 6 colorful worlds to collect energy shards, so they can return home! Robo Rolo is a physics-based 3D collectathon platformer with fine-tuned, skill based movement that's fun to play, and even more fun to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563270/extras/collect2.gif?t=1745548571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to collecting energy shards, which unlock the way forward, you can collect sparks which allow you to upgrade your movement abilities even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563270/extras/small_capsule.png?t=1745548571\" /></p>","developers":["Doodle Donut"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563270/de953cd00e2a98b8bca84c72b7045d644725cac3/header.jpg?t=1745548571","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126007,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126007/movie480.mp4?t=1744664074","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126007/movie_max.mp4?t=1744664074"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126007/421e3cebd7272ecded4e23775211b704607a7748/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744664074","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126007/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744664074","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.co